      "enum": [
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_SENT",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_ACCEPTED",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_FILLED",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_CANCELLED",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_REJECTED",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_FAILED"
      ],
      "default": "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_UNSPECIFIED",
      "description": "- PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_SENT: 송신 — 08:30 전 송신분은 FEP 가 보관\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_ACCEPTED: 거래소 접수 (부분 체결 포함)\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_FILLED: 전량 체결\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_CANCELLED: 취소 — NAV 기준·stop·자동취소 (message)\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_REJECTED: 거래소 거부\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_ITEM_STATE_FAILED: 송신 실패",
      "title": "장전 예약주문 주문 1건의 상태"
    },
    "premarket_order_reservationPremarketOrderReservationState": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_WAITING",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_SENT",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_MONITORING",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_STOPPING",
        "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_STOPPED"
      ],
      "default": "PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_UNSPECIFIED",
      "description": "- PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_WAITING: start 됨 — 송신 시각(08:28) 대기\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_SENT: 송신함 — 감시 시작(08:59:55) 전. 08:30 전이면 FEP 보관 중\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_MONITORING: NAV 기준 취소 감시 중 (08:59:55 ~ 장 마감)\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_STOPPING: stop — 남은 주문 취소 확인 대기\n - PREMARKET_ORDER_RESERVATION_STATE_STOPPED: 끝 — stop·전량 종료·장 마감·송신 실패 (message 참고)",
      "title": "장전 예약주문 실행 상태"
    },
